# Optional. ICE servers for the live-session video rooms, as a JSON array.
#
# The default is a public STUN server, which is enough for most home networks.
# STUN cannot traverse symmetric NAT, though — corporate networks and some
# mobile carriers — and for those peers a TURN relay is the only thing that
# works. If video connects for some participants and not others, this is the
# first thing to check.
#
# VITE_ICE_SERVERS=[{"urls":"stun:stun.l.google.com:19302"},{"urls":"turn:turn.example.com:3478","username":"user","credential":"pass"}]
